{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-wuhuang",
  "id": "source-32301",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32301001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "这边看上去好荒凉啊。爷，我们是在什么地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷，我们接下来该怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷，你怎么不说话了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "你怎么这么多话，安静！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "首先……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "首先我们要离开这里，出去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "好，千里之行，始于足下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "除了周围的东西大了一圈外，也没有什么可奇怪的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷，前面的草丛那好像有什么东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "……是少年喜欢收集的塑料小人？叫手办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "等下，先别靠近！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "啊……她、她好像在动！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "唔，系统自检完成。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "是可爱的猫……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "你们好，我是蒂娅。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷，她在向我们打招呼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "别慌，我们什么大风大浪没见过！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "可是你别躲我身后啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "蒂娅——蒂娅——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来你在这里，我找了好久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "刚才系统出了些错误，现在已经没事了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "又来了一个会动的手办！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "这到底是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，初次见面！你们是新活化的……是潮玩吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "根据数据库的记载，它们是热门漫画《就喜欢你看不惯我又干不掉我的样子》中的吾皇猫和巴扎黑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷，她们在说什么？我们是漫画的角色？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "不管是在哪里的角色，我必定是主角。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "哎，这个世界好陌生啊……我们是在做梦吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……还处在流浪状态吗？不如你们也跟我们一起走吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "小只的人类，你有什么企图吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "说起来，主人的家里最近刚买了个猫爬架。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……猫粮狗粮也有不少，但潮玩需要进食吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "爷……我们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301036",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "巴扎黑目光殷切地望向了吾皇猫。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "既然你都诚心诚意地求我了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "接下来先去那个「主人」的家里休息一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "巴扎黑",
          "text": "好嘞！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，我们还有很多的手办可以介绍给你们认识。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吾皇猫",
          "text": "……像你这样的，居然还有很多？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "欢迎成为我们的新伙伴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，主人知道了应该也会很开心吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301044",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "于是，迎着热烈的阳光，众人开始朝着主人的家前进。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32301045",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "吾皇猫和巴扎黑在手办世界的冒险，就这样开始了……",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
